<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Kaufman Brothers said it started coverage of Compaq Computer Corp with short-and long-term buy.</p>
